+| Requested volume | Measured sample magnitude |
+| --- | ---: |
+| 50% | 6,000 |
+| 100% | 12,000 |
+| 0% | 0 |
+| 25% after mute | 3,000 |
+| Above maximum | 12,000 after clamping |
